# Accepted findings, each with a reason.

# ALB access-log bucket cannot use SSE-KMS (the ELB log delivery service only writes with SSE-S3).
AVD-AWS-0132
# ECS task security group needs any-to-any within itself for gRPC between services; scoped by SG reference, not CIDR.
AVD-AWS-0104

# The ALB is the platform's public entry point by design; it terminates TLS 1.3 and sits behind WAF in prod.
AVD-AWS-0053
